      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리 귀엽고 사랑스러운 카나리의\n얼굴을 본떠서 만든 사상 최고의 빵이지!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그리 선생도 인정했을 정도라네!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9AC0020ADC0C5FDACE00020C0ACB791C2A4B7ECC6B40020CE74B098B9ACC758000AC5BCAD74C7440020BCF8B5A0C11C0020B9CCB4E00020C0ACC0C10020CD5CACE0C7580020BE75C774C9C0002100100001BE00000AADF8B9AC0020C120C0DDB3C40020C778C815D588C7440020C815B3C4B77CB1240021002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대신, 구매할 수 있는 건\n1인당 하루 1개뿐!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300C2E0002C0020AD6CB9E4D5600020C2180020C788B2940020AC74000A0031C778B2F90020D558B8E800200031AC1CBFD0002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어서 오시게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C11C0020C624C2DCAC8C002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자자! 맛도 좋고 먹기 아까울 정도로 귀여운\n카나리빵이 하나에 1300원!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n어때, 사 갈 텐가?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790C79000210020B9DBB3C40020C88BACE00020BA39AE300020C544AE4CC6B80020C815B3C4B85C0020ADC0C5ECC6B4000ACE74B098B9ACBE75C7740020D558B098C5D000200031003300300030C6D0002100100001BE00000AC5B4B54C002C0020C0AC0020AC080020D150AC00003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "살게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고맙네!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B9D9B1240021002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "돈이 부족하지 않은가!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C8C7740020BD80C871D558C9C00020C54AC740AC000021002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 이상은 가지고 다닐 수 없다네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020C774C0C1C7400020AC00C9C0ACE00020B2E4B2D00020C2180020C5C6B2E4B124002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 맛있고도 귀여운 걸\n안 살 수 있다고!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020B9DBC788ACE0B3C40020ADC0C5ECC6B40020AC78000AC5480020C0B40020C2180020C788B2E4ACE00021003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카나리빵은 1인당 하루 1개 한정이라네!\n내일이 되면 또 사러 오게나.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
